                "source": "Loomly",
                "text": "Unions are helping narrow racial wage disparities  \u2014 in fact, union membership means pay premiums of\u2026\n\n17.3% for Black workers\n23.1% for Latino workers\n14.7% for Asian workers\n\nThis is a real difference.\nThis is how the union makes us strong.",
