                "source": "Loomly",
                "text": "Nearly 8,000 Alaskan households applying for Supplemental Nutrition Assistance Program benefits have faced delays of up to 120 days. \n\nThey\u2019re struggling, but they shouldn\u2019t have to. We have to make sure programs like SNAP work for everyone who needs them whenever they need them.",
