                "source": "Loomly",
                "text": "The benefits of millions of Americans are on the line if we don\u2019t raise the debt ceiling. Our health care, prescription drugs, Medicare, and Social Security are all on the chopping block.\n\nNot raising the debt ceiling is reckless and irresponsible. We have to do it.",
