                "source": "Loomly",
                "text": "Veterans are at a 57% higher risk of dying by suicide than those who haven't served. It's beyond time we invest in veteran mental health services to make sure that those defending our freedom every day don\u2019t succumb to that fate. It\u2019s what we owe them for their service.",
