                "source": "Loomly",
                "text": "Percentage of workers with employer-provided health insurance\n\nUnion: 96%\nNon-Union: 69%\n\nThe numbers speak for themselves. Workers with unions have a better likelihood of being covered when they get sick, injured, or face any broad healthcare need. That\u2019s the union difference.",
