                "retweet_count": 5,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "We may have more work to do, but we accomplished (and avoided) a lot through bipartisanship and common sense. One of the main reasons I voted yes on the FRA was because of the consensus we were able to reach, including around the Supplemental Nutrition Assistance Program.",
